    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Duplicate skip</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/subsets-ii/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 90</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Subsets II</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Sort, then backtrack with a start index; at each level, a value already tried in this position would rebuild the same subtree, so skip it: <code>if i &gt; start and nums[i] == nums[i-1]: continue</code>. O(n * 2<sup>n</sup>) time, no hash set needed.</p>\n"
